Hi there,
   I'm working on another crossword puzzle.

  Since I didn't like much the graphical aspect of automatically
generated crosswords, this time I first filled a 13x13 grids with
around 60 words and I'm now writing hints.

  Is there anyone interested in participating? I guess it will take me
some time to find sensible hints for all the words and it would be
beneficial to have more than one person at work.

  remod.


 Btw, has anyone objections against the lujvo {kucvla} defined as:

   x1 is a word/quotation crossing other words/quotations,
meaning/defined by x2, located at x3

example:

  zo melbi cu kucyvla lu da poi do nelci li'u li pare poi pinta

